      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom mid-terrace family home to the Finglas property market. Ideally positioned on the ever-popular and mature Kildonan Road, No. 64 offers spacious, well-proportioned accommodation, a large rear garden, generous off-street parking and a fantastic location overlooking a large green to the front.\n\nPresented in very good condition throughout, this impressive property has been thoughtfully upgraded over the years, including rewiring and replumbing in 2018, 100mm internal wall insulation and attic insulation. Extending to approximately 93 sq.m, the accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, bright front living room, understairs storage, a generous kitchen/dining area with rear extension, and a downstairs family bathroom.\n\nUpstairs boasts three well-proportioned bedrooms, including two spacious double bedrooms and a generous single bedroom, together with a bathroom. The property benefits from double glazing throughout, gas fired central heating, insulated internal walls and a partially floored attic, providing excellent additional storage potential.\n\nTo the rear is a large private garden, offering excellent space for families, outdoor entertaining and gardening enthusiasts. To the front, the property benefits from a private driveway with parking for two cars, complemented by the large green directly to the front of the property.\n\nKildonan Road is ideally situated within easy reach of Finglas Village and a wealth of local amenities including excellent primary and secondary schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, gyms, sports clubs, parks and recreational facilities. Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, Clearwater Shopping Centre and DCU are all easily accessible, while nearby green spaces and parks provide fantastic outdoor leisure opportunities. The area is exceptionally well serviced by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes providing quick and easy access to Glasnevin, Phibsborough, Drumcondra, Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre. The M50, M1, N2 and Dublin Airport are all just minutes away, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nEarly viewing is highly advised contact today on 0861985247 or 015411455 to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features:\n• Approx. 93 sq.m\n• BER C3\n• Excellent three-bedroom mid-terrace family home\n• Presented in very good condition throughout\n• Kitchen extension to rear\n• 100mm internal wall insulation\n• Attic insulated and partially floored\n• Rewired and replumbed in 2018\n• Double glazing throughout\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Downstairs family bathroom\n• Three well-proportioned bedrooms 2 double, 1 single\n• Main bathroom upstairs\n• Valuable understairs storage\n• Large private rear garden\n• Private front driveway with parking for two cars\n• Large green directly to front of property\n• Mature and highly sought-after residential location\n• Within easy reach of Finglas Village and a host of local amenities\n• Close to excellent primary and secondary schools\n• Easy access to Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, Clearwater Shopping Centre and DCU\n• Excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre\n• Quick access to the M50, M1, N2 and Dublin Airport\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, growing families, second-time buyers and investors alike"
      },
